The module extracts the Aggregated_InceptionMamba interaction from the full
RGB matching network. Names and operations of this interaction are retained;
the public interface accepts [B,2,C,H,W] rather than concatenated-width grids.
The released duplicate row-major scan and column-major reassembly are
deliberately retained. Input checks and explicit backend selection are added.
No upstream pretrained weights or full RGB/matching network are distributed.

